OL,3,GNEWSAEx-council boss had incentive to
OL,4,Adelete emails over perception she 'was
OL,5,Atoo close to DUP,' court told
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe emails were sent to DUP politicians
OL,8,FArlene Foster and Gregg McKeen,
OL,9,Fforwarding on a letter Donaghy had sent
OL,10,Fto senior civil servants in London
OL,11,Fraising concerns about the safety of
OL,12,Fstaff carrying out post-Brexit checks
OL,13,Fat Larne Port.
